msgstr "Duba samfurin na biyu"

#: src/onboarding.py:734
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "An kasa yin rikodin samfurin na biyu"

#: src/onboarding.py:735
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must "
"still be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than"
" turning it off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from S"
"ettings."
msgstr ""
"An ajiye samfurin ku na farko, don haka shiga fuska ya riga ya yi aiki"
". Dole ne ɗakin ya kasance mai haske sosai don ganin fuskarka - canza "
"hasken maimakon kashe shi - sannan sake gwadawa, ko tsallake kuma ƙara"
" samfurin daga baya daga Saituna."

#: src/onboarding.py:769
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Na biyu scan: daban-daban lighting"

#: src/onboarding.py:771
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on o"
"r off, move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep y"
"our face clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"An ajiye samfurin farko. Yanzu canza hasken - misali kunna fitila ko k"
"ashe, matsawa daga taga, ko amfani da sauran hasken ɗakin - kiyaye fus"
"karka a bayyane, sannan danna Scan kuma."

#: src/onboarding.py:805
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Saita"

#: src/onboarding.py:818
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Ana duba kayan "
"aikin TPM da kayan aikin..."

#: src/onboarding.py:838
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> An gano kayan a"
"ikin TPM. Ana shigar da <i>tpm2-tools</i> kai tsaye..."

#: src/onboarding.py:850
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Hardware TPM 2."
"0 yana aiki. Za a rufe kalmar sirri ta amintaccen cikin TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:852
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Matsayi:</b> An gano kayan ai"
"kin TPM, amma shigarwa ta atomatik na <i>tpm2-tools</i> ya kasa. Gudu "
"<code>sudo dace shigar tpm2-tools</code>. Faɗuwa zuwa tushen caching n"
"a tushen software."

#: src/onboarding.py:854
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Ba a gano kayan"
" aikin TPM ba. Yin amfani da caching na tushen software (AES-256-GCM)."

