#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Samfurin fuska ɗaya kawai aka yi rajista. Haske yana canza yadda fuska"
"rka ke kallon kyamara, don haka ƙirar guda ɗaya na iya yin kasala da y"
"amma a ƙarƙashin fitilu (ko a cikin hasken rana). Ƙara samfurin na biy"
"u da aka yi rikodin a cikin haske daban-daban don ci gaba da buɗe abin"
" dogaro a kowane lokaci na rana."

